@startuml pipeline_flow_and_parameters
!theme plain
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FEFECE
skinparam NoteBorderColor #A80036

title GN10 Point Cloud Localization Pipeline & Parameter Architecture

actor "Sensors / ROS 2 Topics" as Sensors
participant "Input & Accumulation" as Stage1
participant "Preprocessing & Deskew" as Stage2
participant "Motion Prediction & Search Area" as Stage3
participant "ESDF Matching & Cost Synthesis" as Stage4
participant "Global Recovery Search" as Stage5
participant "Outputs & Telemetry" as Stage6

== 1. Sensor Ingestion & Accumulation ==
Sensors -> Stage1: PointCloud2 (/livox/lidar)\nIMU (/livox/imu)\nLaserScan (/lakibeam/scan)
note over Stage1
  **scan_accumulation.window_s** (0.10s)
  **scan_accumulation.timestamp_field** ("timestamp")
  **scan_accumulation.timestamp_scale** (1e-9)
  **scan_accumulation.timestamp_relative** (false)
  Accumulates multi-frame Livox packets over window_s.
  Indexes IMU angular velocity in YawHistory.
  Uses pinned host memory (h_timed_in_) for fast async H2D copy.
end note

== 2. Preprocessing & Deskew ==
Stage1 -> Stage2: Raw accumulated cloud + IMU samples
note over Stage2
  **filter_params.ground_z_thresh** (0.06m): Ground plane rejection
  **filter_params.robot_radius** (0.80m): Self-chassis / bumper filter
  **filter_params.robot_height_min/max** (0.0m ~ 1.2m): Vertical obstacle bounds
  **filter_params.max_range** (12.0m): Outlier max distance filter
  **filter_params.max_points** (200000): Capacity limit for GPU allocation
  -- 2D LiDAR --
  **lidar_2d.enable** (true)
  **lidar_2d.deskew** (true): Angular beam deskew using IMU integration
  **lidar_2d.tf_wait_sec** (0.05s): Transform lookup timeout
  **lidar_2d.frame_id** ("lakibeam_frame"): Fallback sensor frame
end note

== 3. Motion Prediction & Dynamic Search Bounds ==
Stage2 -> Stage3: Deskewed obstacle points + IMU yaw
note over Stage3
  **velocity_estimation.enable** (true)
  **velocity_estimation.window_sec** (0.20s): Stride window for linear velocity
  **velocity_estimation.min_dt_sec** (0.15s): Minimum delta time for dt division
  **velocity_estimation.max_dt_sec** (0.50s): Maximum allowable dt for extrapolation
  **velocity_estimation.max_linear_velocity** (4.0 m/s): Velocity clamp threshold
  Velocity smoothing: Exponential moving average (EMA alpha = 0.6)
  Extrapolates: base_x = last_x + vx * dt, base_y = last_y + vy * dt
  -- High-Speed Translational Expansion --
  For speed >= 2.0 m/s: Scale range_xy up to 1.5x adaptively
  -- Dynamic Yaw Window Expansion --
  **matching_params.dynamic_yaw_expansion** (true)
  **matching_params.dynamic_yaw_omega_thresh** (0.50 rad/s): Activation threshold
  **matching_params.dynamic_yaw_factor** (0.15s): Scaling factor (omega * factor)
  **matching_params.dynamic_yaw_max_range** (0.40 rad): Upper bound clamp
  Safety clamp: std::max(range_yaw, dynamic_yaw_max_range)
  -- Base Search Windows --
  **matching_params.search_range_xy** (0.30m), **search_step_xy** (0.05m)
  **matching_params.search_range_yaw** (0.15rad), **search_step_yaw** (0.03rad)
end note

== 4. ESDF Matching & Independent Residual Weighting ==
Stage3 -> Stage4: Search window grid & Obstacle points (3D + 2D)
note over Stage4
  **GPU SearchGrid**: Direct candidate pose calculation in GPU kernel (Zero H2D)
  **Adaptive Point Stride**: point_stride = max(1, N_3D / 1200) for coarse phase
  -- 3D/2D Residual Weights --
  **matching_params.min_3d_points** (50): Minimum 3D points required
  **matching_params.min_2d_points** (30): Minimum 2D points to activate 2D residual
  **matching_params.target_2d_points** (200): Target 2D points for 100% FoV weight
  **matching_params.weight_2d_lidar** (0.50): Maximum baseline 2D weight
  **matching_params.max_dist_thresh** (0.25m): ESDF truncation distance
  -- Convergence & Strict Inlier Criteria --
  **matching_params.cost_threshold** (0.165): Threshold on composite cost
  **matching_params.inlier_dist_thresh** (0.08m): Distance threshold for inliers
  **matching_params.min_inliers** (60): Minimum inlier count
  **matching_params.inlier_cost_thresh** (0.01m): Inlier distance threshold
  **matching_params.min_inlier_ratio** (0.35): Required inlier ratio (inliers / total)
  **matching_params.max_inlier_accept_cost** (0.22): Upper cost guard for inlier acceptance
  -- Fine Refinement --
  **matching_params.fine_refine** (true), **matching_params.fine_refine_levels** (2)
end note

alt Match Succeeded (cost < cost_thresh OR strict inlier criteria met)
  Stage4 -> Stage6: Publish estimated pose & reset lost_frame_count
else Match Failed (lost_count < lost_threshold_count)
  Stage4 -> Stage3: Dead reckoning via IMU yaw & velocity extrapolation
else Match Lost (lost_count >= lost_threshold_count)
  == 5. Global Recovery Search ==
  Stage4 -> Stage5: Trigger full field Top-K GPU search
  note over Stage5
    **global_search.range_min_x / max_x** (-5.25m ~ 5.25m)
    **global_search.range_min_y / max_y** (-5.70m ~ 5.70m)
    **global_search.range_yaw_diff** (3.1415rad): Constrained by IMU prior
    **global_search.step_xy** (0.30m), **global_search.step_yaw** (0.30rad)
    **global_search.downsample_stride** (2): Decimation stride for coarse evaluation
    **global_search.top_k_candidates** (4): Top-K NMS candidate extraction
    Evaluates 3D + 2D LiDAR composite cost across coarse grid.
    Copies coarse costs to CPU, filters candidates by NMS (dist >= 1.0m, yaw >= 0.5rad).
    Performs local fine refinement on Top-K candidates.
    Selects best candidate meeting strict acceptance criteria.
  end note
  Stage5 -> Stage6: Recovered pose or retry next frame
end

== 6. Output Generation & Telemetry ==
note over Stage6
  **publish_tf** (true): Broadcasts map -> base_link TF
  **topics.output_pose** (/platform_constraint): PoseWithCovarianceStamped
  **topics.output_localization_success** (/robot/operation/localization_success): Bool
  **topics.output_telemetry** (/localization/telemetry): LocalizationTelemetry (~50Hz)
  **topics.output_obstacle** (/obstacle_cloud): PointCloud2
  **topics.output_ground** (/ground_cloud): PointCloud2
  **topics.output_dynamic** (/dynamic_cloud): PointCloud2 (lazy: only if subscribed)
  **topics.output_2d_deskewed** (/lakibeam/deskewed_cloud): PointCloud2
end note

@enduml
